  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4ed5f55d63a8a14cb8fc3f6624472bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: welcome
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  key: welcome
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - Hiya, new recruit! The name's Art - I'm what you may call a spren. I'm here to
    be your guide through the basics of curating your own museum!
  - You were hired here due to an interest in learning one thing or another, and
    our goal here at the Museum of Memory is to do our best to make it happen! Don't
    worry, it may seem daunting at first, but I'm sure you'll get the hang of it
    in no time!
  - As you continue to learn, your museum will grow in size and popularity - it may
    take time, but I promise it will be worth it!
  - Let's not get ahead of ourselves, though! The first thing you'll need to do each
    shift is to collect the new archives and add them to your collection! Our benefactor
    has decided to space out the delivery of these works so as not to overwhelm you.
    Trust us, instant exposure to thousands of works is enough to make anyone resign
    on the spot!
  - I've outlined the card delivery box in yellow, head on over there and retrieve
    the first fine additions to your collection. The benefactor tells me there may
    be a little extra something in there as a welcoming gift!
  outlineTag: dailyCardDelivery
